Real DesktopController + in-process execute worker + file library; excludes Electron utility-process IPC, rendering, host plugins and production claims.
processCold is first measured operation in a fresh Node process after loading its isolated binding. warm repeats in that process. OS page cache was not purged; seeding and preceding samples may warm it. No application cache is introduced.
readFileSync counts/bytes are logical synchronous application reads including worker code in this process, not physical device I/O; lstatSync/readdirSync calls are also counted. Async binding initialization and JSON serialization are outside durationMs; serializeMs is separate.
Synthetic content; six shared solid-color full-decode PNGs reduce fixture disk use and do not model photographic entropy or hundreds of unique images.
No cover jobs, templates, photo records, collections, or trash in this fixture.
Only one Mac and one dataset size; no commercial capacity or smoothness guarantee.

